"Confirm that no other resident withholding titles are missing from row 01. "
"This adapter covers dividends and author income only."
msgstr ""
"Potvrďte, že v řádku 01 nechybí jiné rezidentské srážkové tituly. Tento "
"adaptér pokrývá pouze dividendy a autorské příjmy."

#. module: l10n_sk_withholding
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_withholding.field_l10n_sk_withholding__cssk_export_warnings
msgid ""
"Content checks that did not block the last export but need a look before "
